        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joel H. Cohen, Robert Cohen, Chuck Sheetz\n- TV Series and Episodes: The Simpsons, Flaming Moe's, Wedding for Disaster, The Wonder Years, The Ben Stiller Show, The Big Bang Theory\n- Places: Calgary, Alberta\n- Roles: writer, director\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Cohen was raised in Calgary, Alberta.\n- Robert Cohen wrote for The Simpsons, The Wonder Years, The Ben Stiller Show, The Big Bang Theory, and many other shows.\n- Robert Cohen penned the The Simpsons season three episode \"Flaming Moe's.\"\n- Joel H. Cohen is the younger brother of writer Robert Cohen.\n- The episode \"Wedding for Disaster\" was written by Joel H. Cohen.\n- The episode \"Wedding for Disaster\" was directed by Chuck Sheetz.",
